# Nixplay

> Nixplay makes Wi-Fi digital picture frames that work with a photo-and-video storytelling platform. Families use the Nixplay app, the web app, or email to send photos and short videos to frames anywhere in the world. Nixplay has more than 4 million customers and sells directly in the United States, United Kingdom, Germany, and Canada.

Praised by ZDNet, Wirecutter (The New York Times), and The Oprah Magazine.

Nixplay is the consumer brand of Creedon Technologies USA LLC, founded in 2013.

Official store: https://www.nixplay.com
Regional stores: UK https://www.nixplay.co.uk · Germany https://www.nixplay.de · Canada https://www.nixplay.ca (English) / https://www.nixplay.ca/fr (French)

## What makes Nixplay different

- **Photos and video together.** Nixplay frames play short video clips with sound in the same slideshow as photos. Many competing frames show photos only.
- **Touchscreen on every current frame.** Swipe, pause, and browse on the frame itself.
- **Many ways to send photos.** Mobile app (iOS and Android), web app, email-to-frame, and Dropbox album sync.
- **One account, many frames.** Connect up to 5 frames free, or up to 10 with a paid plan. Send the same album to every grandparent at once.
- **Gift-ready.** Preload photos, videos, and a gift message before the frame is unboxed, so the recipient does not need to set anything up. https://www.nixplay.com/pages/content-preload
- **AI face-centering.** Faces are automatically kept in frame when photos are cropped to fit the screen.
- **Auto-rotate and activity sensor.** Images rotate for portrait or landscape placement, and the frame turns itself on and off when people are around.
- **Beyond the frame.** Cast slideshows to a smart TV (NixCast), collect guests' photos live at events (Events), and edit photos in the app.
- **Privacy.** Secure, USA-based storage; CCPA and GDPR compliant.

